OL,3,GNEWSAOfford pledges to scrap tax system
OL,4,Aand boost jobs under Reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's leader in Scotland has
OL,7,Fpromised to scrap the six-band income
OL,8,Ftax system, boost jobs and tackle
OL,9,Fimmigration in his speech to the
OL,10,Fparty's conference.
OL,12,FMalcolm Offord addressed members on the
OL,13,Ffinal day of the gathering in
OL,14,FBirmingham.
OL,16,FThe West Scotland MSP said his party
OL,17,Fwould make Scotland "wealthy, healthy
OL,18,Fand the most successful part of the
OL,19,FUK".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
